{"title":"Icebound Harpooner","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 54 Icebound that attacks with slash (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=54\">Lv 54</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>9</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>5</td><td>in the wilds around -69, -1064</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>9</td><td>in the wilds around -130, -1033</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-622.4px,409.1px)\"><i style=\"left:613.6px;top:-401.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:618.2px;top:-407.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:714.3px;top:-407.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:673.0px;top:-380.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:644.9px;top:-400.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:655.8px;top:-370.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:618.8px;top:-428.0px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -143, -1048 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -67, -1057 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"icebound-harpooner\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Icebound: <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand\">Icebound Deckhand</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate\">Icebound Mate</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-captain\">Drowned Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/979aa9929efd4ba5402c.svg\" alt=\"Icebound Harpooner\"></div><h3>Icebound Harpooner</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>54 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 55–56)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Icebound</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · ranged</td></tr>\n    